# Scratch directory: local Go module/build caches (GOMODCACHE=$PWD/.tmp/go-mod-cache)
# and golden-path evidence. All of it is regenerable and uploaded by CI as artifacts
# when needed, so nothing under /.tmp/ is ever committed.
/.tmp/

# Autogenerated roadmap reconciliation reports (local only, one per run/day).
# These accumulate as untracked noise and must never be committed.
ROADMAP_RECONCILIATION_*.md
docs/roadmap-reconciliation-*.md
